  "findings": [
    "Publisher OptiFine J1 loads exact publisher ComplementaryReimagined_r5.9.3.zip with visibly active shader rendering and exact native control evidence.",
    "Ghost and Wraith identities and geometry remain readable across day, night, native rain, dark-background, bright-background, and indoor scenes.",
    "Both entity native OptiFine shader-off/restored sequences show explicit OFF selection, vanilla rendering, exact pack reselection, and restored Complementary rendering.",
    "Movement pairs change position; native damage frames show the expected red hurt tint.",
    "Normal invisibility removes entity geometry while particles remain; spectator translucency is visible on white-backdrop controls; native white outlines are visible.",
    "Seven registered block surfaces, lit-state changes, armor/glint, inventory previews, projectile entities, and the populated Spectral Infuser GUI are present and legible."
  ],
